#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:2
msgid "Configurable Storage Backends"
msgstr "可配置存储后端"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:4
msgid ""
"LMCache supports integrating custom storage backends through dynamic "
"loading or plug and play capability. This allows extending cache storage "
"capabilities without modifying core code."
msgstr "LMCache 支持通过动态加载或即插即用功能集成自定义存储后端。这允许在不修改核心代码的情况下扩展缓存存储功能。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:7
msgid "Backend Definition Requirements"
msgstr "后端定义要求"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:8
msgid "Inherit from ``ConfigurableStorageBackendInterface``"
msgstr "继承自 ``ConfigurableStorageBackendInterface``"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:9
msgid ""
"Implement all the abstract methods of the parent interface of "
"``ConfigurableStorageBackendInterface``- ``StorageBackendInterface``"
msgstr "实现 ``ConfigurableStorageBackendInterface`` 的父接口 ``StorageBackendInterface`` 的所有抽象方法"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:10
msgid "Package as an installable Python module"
msgstr "打包为可安装的 Python 模块"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:14
msgid ""
"The interface constructor is the instantiation contract that the LMCache "
"loading system will use when loading configurable storage backends. If "
"you wish to implement a constructor, it should have the same parameter "
"signature and call the interface constructor."
msgstr "接口构造函数是 LMCache 加载系统在加载可配置存储后端时将使用的实例化契约。如果您希望实现构造函数，它应该具有相同的参数签名并调用接口构造函数。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:18
msgid "How to Integrate the Backend with LMCache"
msgstr "如何将后端与 LMCache 集成"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:19
msgid "Install your backend package in the LMCache environment"
msgstr "在 LMCache 环境中安装您的后端包"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:20
msgid ""
"Add ``external_backends`` and its related ``module_path`` and "
"``class_name`` to ``extra_config`` section of LMCache configuration as "
"follows:"
msgstr "将 ``external_backends`` 及其相关的 ``module_path`` 和 ``class_name`` 添加到 LMCache 配置的 ``extra_config`` 部分，如下所示："

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:32
msgid "An example configuration for a logging backend is as follows:"
msgstr "日志后端的示例配置如下："

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:46
msgid ""
"Backends are initialized in order during LMCache startup - earlier "
"backends have higher priority during cache lookups"
msgstr "后端在 LMCache 启动期间按顺序初始化 - 较早的后端在缓存查找期间具有更高的优先级"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:47
msgid ""
"``external_backends.<backend_name>`` distinguishes the different dynamic "
"loaded backends"
msgstr "``external_backends.<backend_name>`` 区分不同的动态加载后端"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:50
msgid "Backend Implementation Example"
msgstr "后端实现示例"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/external_backend.rst:51
msgid ""
"A sample backend implementation can be viewed at "
"https://github.com/opendataio/lmc_external_log_backend/"
msgstr "示例后端实现可以在 https://github.com/opendataio/lmc_external_log_backend/ 查看"

